        {
            "heading": "Checksum",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Each patch has an associated checksum that allows to verify the installation is correct."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "It is displayed at two places:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "On the CK2 launcher: it is the reference/expected checksum (hardcoded).",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "On the game lobby, in the bottom left: it is the actual checksum, dynamically calculated from the loaded game files.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Rolling back to an older version",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Older stable versions are available through Steam Beta tab. It gives \"people a chance to finish of saves already started! (in case a patch breaks save files, or game mechanics changed too much for your liking)\" [2]"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "To rollback :"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Right-click Crusader Kings II in the game library",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Click on Properties",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Select the BETAS tab",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Select the version in the dropdown",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Wait for game files to update",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "In the launcher, unselect any DLC released after the selected patch, otherwise the game will crash.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "If the version you are rolling back to is from before the GDPR changes took effect, you will need to get a code from Paradoxplaza. Click Show below Your Games . Copy the code for CK2, and paste it below the drop down menu in the BETAS tab. [3]"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The process is the same to go back to current version, by selecting NONE in the drop down menu instead."
                }
            ]
        },
